            "detailed_description": "Simple Spy is a dynamic and minimalist 2d platformer. Though Simple Spy is a minimalist platformer,you can also find all fun and essence needed for a full fledged platformer. everything in Simple Spy is achieved through a combination of three action such as running,jumping and rolling.the main focus of the game is simplicity  with hard core gameplay and unique game features and obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore 75 levels and 5 bonus levels<br></li><li>6 different character with unique animation to unlock<br></li><li>Challenging gameplay based on color changing platform.<br></li><li>Minimalist Levels but Hardcore gameplay</li></ul>",
