                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After getting this game for free, I thought: \"Nah, the best thing about this game will probably be the name.\" Boy, was I wrong. This game has everything that made Super Mario fun (except the release on a Nintendo console):\n[list]\n[*]it's hard (mostly because the guy keeps sliding after releasing the button)\n[*]the soundtrack is great\n[*]and you have to force yourself to quit after a long and frustrating session\n\nSo I think everyone who likes the old Super Mario or challenging Jump 'n' Runs in general, will be happy with this game",
